          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "_customTemplate": true,
          "_afterNavbarItem": false,
          "_customHTML": "<!-- Type valid HTML here -->\n\n<div>\n    <h1 class=\"display-1\">5 Benefits of Gratitude</h1>\n    <!--h2 class=\"display-3\">5 Benefits of Gratitude</h2-->\n    <p class=\"display-2\">🌱 1. Improved Mental Health</p> \n    <p style=\"text-indent: 30px;\">\n<br>- Reduces symptoms of depression and anxiety\n<br>- Boosts overall mood and emotional resilience\n    <br>- Helps reframe negative experiences with a more balanced perspective</p>\n    <br> \n    <p class=\"display-2\">🧠 2. Enhanced Cognitive Clarity</p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 30px;\">\n<br>- Strengthens focus and attention on what truly matters\n<br>- Encourages a mindset of abundance rather than scarcity\n <br>- Supports better decision-making by reducing emotional clutter</p>\n<br>\n\n    <p class=\"display-2\">❤️ 3. Stronger Relationships</p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 30px;\">\n<br>- Fosters empathy and deeper connection with others\n<br>- Encourages acts of kindness and reciprocity\n   <br>- Builds trust and appreciation in both personal and communal settings </p>\n<br>\n\n    <p class=\"display-2\">🛌 4. Better Sleep and Physical Health</p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 30px;\">\n<br>- Gratitude journaling before bed improves sleep quality\n<br>- Lowers blood pressure and supports heart health\n    <br>- Reduces stress hormones like cortisol</p>\n<br>\n\n    <p class=\"display-2\">🔥 5. Spiritual and Identity Anchoring</p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 30px;\">\n<br>- Grounds you in purpose and humility\n<br>- Strengthens your sense of belonging\n    <br>- Gives clarity to how God has been gracious\n    <br>- Reinforces values like thankfulness, stewardship, and joy</p>\n    <p></p><br><br>\n    <p class=\"display-1\">Next you’ll find a 2-week gratitude log button. Print it out and take the challenge—discover how much better you’ll feel simply by choosing to write down three things you’re grateful for each day.\n<br>Each morning, take a moment to review what you’ve written. Don’t worry about spelling, grammar, or perfect sentence structure—this is just for you. Let it be honest, raw, and real.\n<br><br>You can include anything that brings you joy or fulfillment:\n</p><p style=\"text-indent: 30px;\">\n    <br> - Completed goals\n    <br>- Tasks you’ve accomplished\n    <br>- Moments of peace or connection </p>\n    \n<p class=\"display-1\">This is your space to reflect, recharge, and realign. Ready to begin?\n    <br> <br>By the way this is like anything else. <br>If you look for things to be gratefull for you will find them.\n </p>\n    <!--div class=\"col-lg-6\">\n\n                <!--p class=\"mbr-text2 mbr-fonts-style pb-4\">\n                    I considered adding the previous statement here and to include and example like when you buy new car that you didn't think was popular and after you buy yours you find out not only is the car popular but everyone has it in the same color. when we aren't looking for something we don't see it. but that might be over kill. </p>\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"index.html\">Home</a> <a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"page11.html#header03-30\">To the Top</a></div>\n            </div -->\n    <div class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"index.html\">Home</a> <a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"page11.html#header03-30\">To the Top</a><a class=\"btn btn-secondary\" href=\"assets/files/My-GratitudeLog.pdf\">Gratitude Log</a></div>\n    \n    <!-- this is a black rectangle button a class=\"btn btn-black\" href=\"assets/files/My-GratitudeLog.pdf\">Gratitude Log</a></div -->\n\n</div>",
          "_customCSS": "/* Type valid CSS here */\n\ndiv {\n  padding: 80px 0;\n  color: #777;\n  text-align: center;\n}\np {\n  font-size: 40px;\n  color: #777;\n}\n@media (min-width: 992px) {\n  p {\n    max-width: 95%;\n  }\n}\n.mbr-section-subtitle {\n  background: white;\n  color: #ffffff;\n  width: fit-content;\n  border-radius: 2rem;\n  padding: 5px 1rem;\n  text-align: left;\n}\n.subtitle-wrap {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  border-radius: 2rem;\n  padding: 0.5rem;\n  padding-bottom: 0;\n  background: @primaryColor;\n  flex-direction: row;\n  width: fit-content;\n  align-items: center;\n  margin-bottom: 2rem;\n  .mbr-iconfont {\n    padding: 0 15px;\n    padding-bottom: 8px;\n    margin: 0;\n    color: @secondaryColor;\n    font-size: 1.5rem;\n  }\n}\n.mbr-section-title {\n  color: #04492e;\n}\n.mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn {\n  color: #6e6e6e;\n}\n.mbr-section-subtitle, .align-wrapper {\n  color: #04492e;\n}\n.mbr-section-title2 {\n  color: #04492e;\n}\n.mbr-text2, .mbr-section-btn {\n  color: #6e6e6e;\n}\n",
